meta {
  name: Get Application
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/college-admin/applications/{{applicationId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{staffAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Full read-only detail for one Application — personal/family/address/
  qualification details, declaration, every non-withdrawn course (with fee
  + chosen quota name), every uploaded document, and every payment
  (application fee + token fee, each with its own transaction history).
  Requires staff_member auth, no special permission code. 404 if the
  application doesn't exist or belongs to a different college.

  `payments[]` — one entry per StudentFeeLedger row tied to any of this
  application's courses (application_fee and token_fee both key off
  applicationCourseId), each with its nested `transactions[]` (usually one,
  more than one only on a retried/failed-then-succeeded payment).

  Response is a single object (not `{applications, meta}` like List
  Applications) — `data` is the `ApplicationDetailDto` directly.

  `personalDetails`/`familyDetails`/`addressDetails`/`qualificationDetails`
  are merged: the Application's own frozen snapshot (set once, at submit)
  if non-empty, else the Student's live profile data (for a still-draft
  application).
}
